 ion is for you!Register here! (https://events.zoom.us/ev/AqZTAiMiq5Zg0Zxp
 J2Tb9MgP0mdjXfCD7YYWu1XuYyFvmFX5ea-9~AvUTE84T0cwnTsT2W6wG7tzekTIte_uEX9fX
 u0yIXyMmn0z_D5Gk24QHGA)  For more information\, visit the SRJC Undocu •
  Immigrant • Dream Center Website (https://dream.santarosa.edu/workshop
 s-events-2025-2026)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Using the past\, to inform the present\
 , to shape the future.</p><p>  From Dream Clubs in local colleges to a na
 tional movement\, undocumented youth turned isolation into community and 
 community into power. Whether you're into history\, social movements\, or
  you're simply curious about how a disenfranchised community built nation
 al influence\, this conversation is for you!</p><p><a href="https://event
 s.zoom.us/ev/AqZTAiMiq5Zg0ZxpJ2Tb9MgP0mdjXfCD7YYWu1XuYyFvmFX5ea-9~AvUTE84
 T0cwnTsT2W6wG7tzekTIte_uEX9fXu0yIXyMmn0z_D5Gk24QHGA" target="_blank" rel=
 "noopener">Register here!</a></p><p>  For more information\, visit the <a
  href="https://dream.santarosa.edu/workshops-events-2025-2026" target="_b
 lank" rel="noopener">SRJC Undocu • Immigrant • Dream Center Website</
 a></p>
